                                "example_id": "09f9dc8c-0845-48b4-a3aa-a9352a67bf8b",
                                "sense_id": "2489dd54-6910-33e3-aba4-778615c26a09",
                                "text": "Firstly, at that time MBT said that it was built because they based on projection of demands and not based on the build-to-order process."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92ce4f79-225b-4fd8-b8d4-ee06e723796f",
                                "sense_id": "2489dd54-6910-33e3-aba4-778615c26a09",
                                "text": "A build-to-order flat is the cheapest public housing type in Singapore, but entails a long waiting time, as its name suggests."
                            },
