                                "example_id": "add510a7-62e6-425f-bcc4-41cbc051ad2b",
                                "sense_id": "2489dd54-6910-33e3-aba4-778615c26a09",
                                "text": "2017, Cara Wong, The Straits Times (Singapore), BTO first, propose later: Young couples don’t regret applying for flat first, 4 June (online).\nWith an average wait of three to four years for the completing of a Build-To-Order (BTO) flat – often the most affordable option for young couples – planning far ahead has long been the norm."
                            }
